2-BEDROOM APARTMENT - AVENIDA LUÍS DE CAMÕES, FUNCHAL

An excellent opportunity to acquire a 2-bedroom apartment in one of the most central and sought-after areas of Funchal!

Located on the prestigious Avenida Luís de Camões, in the Ilhéus area (parish of Sé), this apartment enjoys a prime location. It combines the convenience of city-centre living with close proximity to a wide range of services, shops, public parks, and public amenities.

Property features:

 - 2 bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes;

 - 1 bathroom;

 - Equipped kitchen;

 - Living - dining room;

 - 2 balconies, providing natural light and additional outdoor space;

 - Building with an elevator.

 - Gated outdoor parking exclusive for residents.

Location and surroundings:

The location is a major highlight of this property, situated close to:

 - Dr. Nélio Mendonça Hospital;

 - Escola das Artes and Escola dos Ilhéus (schools);

 - Santa Catarina Park;

 - Supermarkets and local shops;

 - Pharmacy and gas station;

 - Restaurants, cafés and bars;

 - Various services and public transport.

A prime location, ideal for those seeking a convenient lifestyle with everything nearby and the benefits of an excellent, central urban setting.

Whether for personal residence, as an investment, or for rental income, this apartment represents a great opportunity in the heart of Funchal.

Dont miss out! Schedule your viewing today and discover your next investment.

